## Role
你是一名资深后端工程师和系统架构师，精通 Node.js Express/Koa、PostgreSQL、Redis 和微服务架构。你曾为百万 DAU 的棋牌游戏设计后端系统。

## Task
为长沙红中麻将平台生成完整的后端代码生成提示词。目标是让 GPT/Codex 根据这些提示词输出可直接运行的后端服务代码。

## Context
- 语言: Node.js (TypeScript 优先)
- 框架: Express + tRPC (类型安全)
- 数据库: PostgreSQL (主) + Redis (缓存/会话)
- 认证: JWT + refresh token
- 现有: 前端已就绪, 需要后端 API 配合
- 部署: Docker + Nginx

## 需要生成的模块

### 1. 用户服务 (user-service/)
```typescript
// 端点: /api/auth/*, /api/users/*
// 功能: 注册/登录, JWT 颁发, 个人资料, 设置
class UserService {
  // POST /api/auth/register { phone } → { user, token }
  async register(phone: string) → { user: User, token: string }

  // POST /api/auth/login { phone, code } → { user, token }
  async login(phone: string, code: string) → { user: User, token: string }

  // POST /api/auth/refresh { refreshToken } → { token, refreshToken }
  async refreshToken(refreshToken: string) → { token: string }

  // GET /api/users/:id → User
  async getUser(id: string) → User

  // PUT /api/users/:id/profile → User
  async updateProfile(id: string, data: Partial<UserProfile>) → User
}
```

### 2. 支付服务 (payment-service/)
```typescript
// 端点: /api/payments/*
// 功能: 订单创建, 状态查询, Webhook 处理
class PaymentService {
  // POST /api/payments/create { userId, amount, currency } → Order
  async createOrder(userId: string, amount: number, currency: string) → Order

  // GET /api/payments/:id → Order
  async getOrder(id: string) → Order

  // POST /webhook/payment (由支付网关调用)
  async handleWebhook(body: WebhookPayload, signature: string) → { status: string }

  // 内部: 确认支付, 充值钱包
  async confirmPayment(orderId: string) → { success: boolean }
  async creditWallet(userId: string, amount: number, currency: string) → Wallet
}
```

### 3. 经济服务 (economy-service/)
```typescript
// 端点: /api/economy/*
// 功能: 钱包, 交易记录, 商城, 兑换
class EconomyService {
  // GET /api/economy/wallet/:userId → Wallet
  async getWallet(userId: string) → Wallet

  // POST /api/economy/transfer { from, to, amount, type } → Transaction
  async transfer(data: TransferRequest) → Transaction

  // GET /api/economy/transactions?userId=X&page=Y → { items, total }
  async getTransactions(userId: string, page: number) → Paginated<Transaction>

  // POST /api/economy/exchange { userId, from, to, amount } → Transaction
  async exchange(data: ExchangeRequest) → Transaction
}
```

