## 代码清单

### 1. 支付网关客户端 (gateway-client.js)
```javascript
class PaymentGatewayClient {
  constructor(config: { apiKey, secret, baseUrl })

  // 创建订单: 调用支付网关创建支付地址
  async createOrder(params: {
    amount: number,
    currency: string,       // USDT / BTC / ETH
    orderId: string,        // 游戏侧订单号
    customerId: string,
    webhookUrl: string,
    expiresInMinutes: number
  }) → Promise<{
    paymentId: string,
    address: string,
    network: string,
    cryptoAmount: number,
    qrCodeUrl: string,
    expiresAt: string
  }>

  // 查询订单状态
  async getOrderStatus(paymentId: string) → Promise<{
    status: 'pending' | 'paid' | 'completed' | 'expired',
    confirmations: number,
    txId: string | null
  }>

  // 生成签名
  generateSignature(payload: object) → string

  // 验证 Webhook 签名
  verifyWebhookSignature(body: string, signature: string) → boolean
}
```

### 2. 订单服务 (order-service.js)
